        "full-FOL, standpoint/world/time-indexed, and aggregate-comparison (COUNT/SUM threshold) integrity conditions exceed that fragment; there is no formula-level aggregate term, so an aggregate comparison cannot be expressed as a genuine GROUP BY sub-SELECT and is carried-and-flagged, not projected" ,
        "the projectable fragment is a range-restricted, ∀-guarded integrity condition (guard(this) → φ(this)) whose per-focus condition φ is a Horn / NNF tree of binary atoms, existentials, disjunctions and (path-)universals: it lowers to a SELECT $this WHERE { guard ∧ ¬φ } via BGP + FILTER NOT EXISTS + UNION" ,
        "the surface is emit-only: there is no parse-back from a sh:SPARQLConstraint into a logic:Constraint (the logic: canon is the authoring ground, Principle 4)" ;
    logic:complexityClass "closed-world SPARQL constraint (SHACL Core)" ;
    logic:preservationKind logic:ValidationOnly .

<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/target/property-path:https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/logic/ancestorsTo3>
    a logic:ProjectionTarget ;
    rdfs:label "property-path:https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/logic/ancestorsTo3" ;
    gmeow:lossyDrop "a predicate wildcard has no SPARQL §9 operator; its edge relation is materialized by a namespace-scoped pre-pass before the depth closure" ,
        "bounded depth {n,m} and the predicate wildcard are GMEOW property-path extensions beyond SPARQL 1.1 §9; a consumer restricted to standard SPARQL receives the unrolled (bounded) or approximated (wildcard) form" ,
        "modal/world context and contextual scope are not carried by a path surface" ;
    logic:complexityClass "terminating/PTIME-data (bounded); regular (unbounded)" ;
    logic:preservationKind logic:SoundUnderApproximation .

<https://blackcatinformatics.ca/logic/target/property-path:https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/logic/nearbyOrgs>
    a logic:ProjectionTarget ;
    rdfs:label "property-path:https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/examples/logic/nearbyOrgs" ;
    gmeow:lossyDrop "a predicate wildcard has no SPARQL §9 operator; its edge relation is materialized by a namespace-scoped pre-pass before the depth closure" ,
        "bounded depth {n,m} and the predicate wildcard are GMEOW property-path extensions beyond SPARQL 1.1 §9; a consumer restricted to standard SPARQL receives the unrolled (bounded) or approximated (wildcard) form" ,
        "modal/world context and contextual scope are not carried by a path surface" ;
    logic:complexityClass "terminating/PTIME-data (bounded); regular (unbounded)" ;
    logic:preservationKind logic:SoundUnderApproximation .

